    "description": "An ancient city of Media (modern western Iran) that was known to 19th and early 20th century scholars and collectors. The site was largely looted out by the early 20th century and never received a modern systematic archaeological excavation.",
    "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Dinavar?</p>",
