            "description": "",
            "details": "<p><em>Dīnever</em>: It is a town at the foot of the mountains to the west of <em>Hamadān</em> (Hamadan). According to the author of <em>Menāhicü’l-fikr</em>, <em>Dīnever</em> is called <em>Māhıkūfe</em>, just as <em>Nihāvend</em> is called <em>Māhıbaṣra</em>. [translation]</p>",
            "end": 1599,
